      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apeyo a arwosit a ŋina alo Seba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari arwosit ŋina alo Seba arwonu a Solomon, (arwon ŋina araakar ekiro ke Ekapolon eturuunit iŋes), abu arwosit ŋin bu akikatakin Solomon a ŋakiŋiseta a ŋuna atyoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu arwosit ŋin bu Yerusalem, torukut ka ŋituŋa ŋulu alalak, ŋikaala ŋulu ewokito ŋikito ŋulu akukunyok, egolid ŋolo alalan nooi ka ŋamoru ŋuna epol egyelit. Abu arwosit ŋin bu neni a Solomon kiyana ka iŋes ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna ayakar iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋonok Solomon ŋakiŋiseta keŋ daadaŋ mam ŋakiro abu erwosit toryamu etyoko akisileerekin arwosit ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kedau arwosit ŋina a Seba akiŋolikin aosou a Solomon daadaŋ, akai ŋina kebu Solomon toduk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akimuj ŋina ayai lomesa keŋ, epite ŋolo eboiyoto ŋikapolok anapukan a Solomon, epite ŋolo etiyaata ŋiketiyak ŋulu etiyanakinete Solomon, epite ŋolo anapitotor ŋiketiyak ŋul, epite ŋolo ayakatar ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni a Solomon ka ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ŋuna aayenene Solomon Kai ke Ekapolon, toumok arwosit ŋin nooi todaun ŋuna elimuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema arwosit ŋin neni a Solomon, “Iyookino ŋakiro ŋuna abu ayoŋ eira anakwap kaŋ, ŋuna a ŋiticisyo a ŋulu idau iyoŋ akitiya ka ŋuna ka aosou kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai pa abu ayoŋ onup ŋakiro ŋun akitodol ŋina abunio ayoŋ ne eŋolik a ŋakonyen kaŋ ka alope. Kire, pa akalimokinitae ayoŋ tari atutubet apei a ŋuna eŋolik; anaosou kon ka alobari kon, eŋolik ayoŋ ŋuna edeparito ŋuna aris ayoŋ keira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoe etya alakara a ŋikilyok a akwap kon ai! Okoe etya alakara a ŋikapolok anapukan kon ai a ŋulu irukito ka iyoŋ jwi jwi topupete ŋakiro ŋuna ka aosou ŋuna irworo iyoŋ ai! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akipuro toyai neni ke Ekapolon Akuj kon, ŋina alakari a ŋuna kon, ido ikiinak iyoŋ akiboikin lokicoloŋ ikwapei erwosit a ŋituŋa a Isirael. Aŋuna ka amina ka Akuj Ŋisirael ŋikaru ka ŋikaru, ikituruwo iŋes iyoŋ erwosit, ikotere itubi ŋakiro anakiyookino ka kitiyae ŋuna iyookino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inak nai arwosit ŋina a Seba erwosit ŋatalantae amiat ka ŋatomoniarei ŋuna ke egolid, ŋikito ŋulu ekukuny ŋulu alalak ka ŋamoru ŋuna epol egyelit; mam apaki ace ŋina ayaunitere neni a Solomon ŋikito ŋulu ekukuny ŋulu alalak, ŋulu etya ŋulu abu arwosit ŋina a Seba inak erwosit Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu daŋ ŋameeli a Iram ŋuna ewokunitere egolid alo Opir, yaut alo Opir ŋakito ŋuna alalak ŋuna enyaritae Alemugim ka ŋamoru ŋuna epol egyelit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit kitiyau anakito a ŋuna ka Alemugim ŋipirin ka Akai ke Ekapolon, ka ŋipirin ŋulu ka akai ke erwosit, ŋagitae ka ŋaduŋgui, ŋuna a ŋikaeok; mam ŋakito ŋuna alalak ŋuna atya ŋun ŋuna aponi yaunae Isirael kori eŋolikin tari tokona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai erwosit Solomon inak arwosit ŋina a Seba ibore daadaŋ ŋini acamit iŋes ka ŋini eŋita iŋes pa imarakinitae ŋulu abu Solomon inak iŋes alobari keŋ a ŋolo a ekepukan. Abu nai arwosit ŋin toboŋo nakwap keŋ kaapei ka ŋiketiyak keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebari a Solomon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aryamununui Solomon a ŋolokaru egolid ŋolo arae apotis keŋ ŋitalantae ŋamiae ŋakanikapei ka ŋatomonikanikapei ka ŋikanikapei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pa imarakinitae ŋolo aryamununui iŋes aneni a ŋimucurus ka aneni a ŋirwosi a daadaŋ a ŋulu ka Arabia ta aneni a ŋikapolok anakwap keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit Solomon kitiyau ŋaupala ŋuna apolok ŋamiae ŋaarei a egolid a ŋolo etyekitae, kitiyau iŋes ŋinaupal a egolid a ŋolo arae ŋakiloi ŋauni ka atutubet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Solomon kitiyau ŋaupala ŋuna cicik ŋamiae ŋauni a egolid a ŋolo etyekitae, kitiyau iŋes ŋinaupal a egolid a ŋolo aapiyaritŋakiloi ŋaarei. Kiwuak erwosit ŋaupala ŋun kai ka apukan ŋina anyaritae Akai ŋina ka Amoni a Lebanon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau daŋ erwosit ekicoloŋ a ŋikyal a ŋitome, toburusik egolid ŋolo ajokan nooi lokicoloŋ ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi lokicoloŋ ŋol ŋadoketa ŋakanikapei. Aluluŋ kaku alokidiama ekicoloŋ ŋol, ayai ŋolowae a ekicoloŋ a ŋol neni apete ŋakan a ituŋanan iboi. Diyete neni apeneneete ŋakan, ayakasi ŋitorubei a ŋiŋatunyo ŋiarei ŋulu awuasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awuasi daŋ ŋitorubei a ŋiŋatunyo ŋitomon ka ŋiarei anadoketa a ekicoloŋ a ŋol, epei ŋatuny epeiwae neni isalya ŋinadoket alotooma ŋadoketa ŋunakanikapei. Mam ibore etiyatae anakwap ka adio ŋini ekwaan ka ekicoloŋ ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu amasya erwosit Solomon, arae ŋulu etiyaunitae a egolid ka ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu ayakasi kai ŋina anyaritae Akai ŋina ka amoni a ŋina alo Lebanon, arae ŋulu etiyaunitae a egolid bon, meere a esilipa, anerae arae esilipa ibore koŋin alorwa a ŋulu a Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakar erwosit ŋameeli ŋuna alalak ŋuna alo Tarisis ŋuna kicurutaet ananam kaapei ka ŋuna a Iram. Ayaununeete ŋameeli ŋuna alo Tarisis egolid, esilipa, ŋikyal a ŋitome, ŋicomin ka ŋikyeny ŋulu ebusak, apeiyaunet kelunyar ŋikaru ŋiuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abarit ka aos erwosit Solomon nooi akilo ŋirwosi ŋuluce daadaŋ anakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa daadaŋ anakwap kiitana akiryamun ka Solomon, ikotere iirarete ŋuna ka aosou keŋ a ŋina kebu Akuj kiwuak natameta keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaununui ŋinituŋanan abuni aanyun Solomon ŋiboro ŋulu arae ŋainakineta ŋulu etiyaunitae a esilipa ka egolid. Ayaununeete ikes ŋilowi, ŋiboro ŋulujiet, ŋikito ŋulu ekukuny, ŋaŋolei ka ŋaŋolei-sigirya. Ayaununuyo ŋul elalak a ŋolokaru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
