              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tocunak Solomon iwapei ŋagaari ka ŋaŋolei, arae ekimar a ŋagaari a ŋuna ayakar iŋes aliput ka ŋamiae ŋaomwon ka arae ekimar a ŋaŋolei ŋalipyo ŋatomon ka ŋaarei ŋulu edaritere ikes ka ŋace kiwuak Yerusalem neni eboiyo iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu erwosit kitepetu esilipa alo Yerusalem ikwa ŋamoru ka abu kitalala ŋikito a Cedar nooi ikwa ŋikito ŋulu ke eki ŋulu aya Sepela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agyelununui Solomon ŋaŋolei nakwap keŋ alo Ijipit ka alo Kue, ido arae ŋimucurus ŋulu a erwosit ikes agyelununeete ŋaŋolei ŋun alo Kue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agyelununuyo ŋagaari a Ijipit a ŋicekelya a ŋulu a esilipa a ŋamiae a ŋakanikapei, ido agyelununuyo ŋaŋolei a ŋicekelya a ŋulu a esilipa a amiat ka ŋatomonikan. Agyelanarete ŋimucurus a erwosit ŋaŋolei ŋun ka ŋagaari ŋun lorwosi ŋulu a Ŋiitaiti ka ŋulu ka Aram.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
